(q/'REPORT.md').write_text('The actual public Pair18 app received Test through real on-screen keyboard taps, enabled Save, committed a sixth task and tenth outbox record, and reopened in a fresh process. All five prior tasks and nine prior outbox rows are preserved. No command mutated the separate original package; its final bytes were not read after the selector failure.\n\nThe R188 runtime script reported failure only because its final selector required bare Test. Its captured native hierarchy already contains the visible TextView `6. Test · Not completed` plus Complete/Move controls. Root corrected that selector, verified the exact node and visible bounds against the captured hierarchy, checked durable task identity/prefixes and rejected four wrong labels. The verification uses the completed second save observation; the first retained observation correctly still shows the pre-save five/nine state. No additional native run or Save occurred. The original failed script/result remain preserved.\n\nThe emulator exited 0, its serial disappeared in a fresh inventory and the external baseline is unchanged. This accepts the observed headless API37 public-SDK app flow. Full IME composition, keyboard/window parity, phones, immutable packages and GA remain pending.\n')
